============================================================
Script Name: netmiko_backup_multiple_routers.py


Purpose:
This script automatically connects to multiple Cisco IOS routers using Netmiko and SSH.


For each router, the script:
1. Establishes an SSH connection.
2. Enters privileged EXEC (enable) mode.
3. Retrieves the running configuration.
4. Detects the router hostname.
5. Creates a backup filename using the hostname.
6. Saves the running configuration to a text file.
7. Handles connection and authentication errors.
============================================================